# The Luban pointer theme (luban:cursors): pixel art on a 12x12 grid, one
# character a pixel, the same style as the Luban OS app's badges. Scaled by
# nearest neighbour to 2x density (24 px at density 1, 48 at 2, 72 at 3):
# whole multiples only, never a blurred edge.
#
#   .  transparent     K  outline      W  fill
#   A  accent          R  red          G  grey
#
# `cursor <css name> <hotspot x> <hotspot y>` then 12 rows (up to 16: the
# arrow's tail runs one column over every two rows, as a pointer's does). The names are
# opensal's kCursors (CSS names); `alias <x11 name> <css name>` lines name
# what an X client asks for. Source of truth for both the host's pointer and
# the theme a Luban system installs (xlings design 2026-10-19 §15.2).
# License: Apache-2.0.

